 "pattern": "Hash maps + a heap that merges each person's newest tweets",
 "statement": "Design a tiny Twitter: `postTweet(user, tweetId)`, `follow(a, b)`, `unfollow(a, b)` and `getNewsFeed(user)`, which returns the ids of the 10 most recent tweets posted by the user or by anyone the user follows, newest first.",
